# API App (`apps/api`)

## Route Structure

```
src/app/api/
  [[...rest]]/route.ts   oRPC RPC handler (/api/rpc) + OpenAPI reference (/api/rpc/api-reference)
  auth/[...all]/route.ts Better Auth (/api/auth), owner Spotify login
src/lib/                 cors, response, error payload helpers
src/instrumentation.ts   points the Trigger.dev SDK at the self-hosted instance
trigger.config.ts        Trigger.dev project config, tasks discovered from src/trigger
```

## Rules

- CORS allows only the dashboard and API origins (`src/lib/cors.ts`)
- Context comes from `createContext(headers)` in `@lyterion/orpc`, auth from `@lyterion/core`
- Trigger.dev tasks live in `packages/common/src/trigger/tasks/`, re-export them from `src/trigger/` for CLI discovery
